book/pdf-overlay/ and paper-2013/pdf-overlay/ are generated by formal-companion and ship PDF.js
(Apache License 2.0) and Literature Links; see THIRD_PARTY.md in each.

The PDFs of H. A. Helfgott's papers (arXiv:1501.05438v2, arXiv:1312.7748v2) are not included.
The viewer fetches them from arxiv.org and checks their sha256. Their source text is not included
either: data/ gives each passage's file and character offsets in the arXiv e-print, with its length
and sha256, and scripts/source_text.py restores it from the e-print.
